{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14223130","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14223130","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1422313001:1":{"text":"フェリダさん、ご招待ありがとうございます！あなたにサプライズを持ってきましたよ！それは……ハルグさんです！","source_cn":"弗瑞达，我们来啦！我们给你带来了惊喜。看！哈尔格回来啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC59D9127783F52D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422313002:1":{"text":"あれ？あまり驚いていませんね。","source_cn":"弗瑞达看上去一副意料之中的样子呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x750D4CF34AEA6DF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422313003:1":{"text":"実は返事が来なくなって、もしかしたら帰路についてるのかもって予想してたんです。","source_cn":"其实，从哈尔格没有回信开始，我就猜到他或许在回家的路上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9873D185014E9B1D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422313004:1":{"text":"そこに突然、謎の親切な方が現れて、手伝えることがないかなんて言うんですもの……","source_cn":"再加上突然有好心的陌生人帮助我和塔莉，像是受人所托的样子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA887233D5737089D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422313005:1":{"text":"うーん……演技が見透かされてたってことですね……そんなに怪しかったでしょうか？","source_cn":"唔……！满满演得不像好心的魔法使魔吗！我们难道看起来很...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72F8148AC975837F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title